                                    JC-464414
                                </div>
                                -
                                <div style="display: inline-table; max-width: 400px; text-wrap: normal;">
                                    <span id="lblWorkingTitleHeader">CLINICAL COUNSELOR - Pleasant Valley State Prison (PVSP)</span>
                                    
                                        <br />
                                        Clinical Counselor
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <p>
                                <span id="lblPrimarySalary">$7,896.00 - $10,076.00 per Month</span>
